Because $a$ and $b$ aren't adjacent to themselves originally, if their 4 positions form $\{i, i+1\}$ and $\{j, j+1\}$, each of these adjacent index pairs must initially contain exactly one $a$ and one $b$. Hence, $a$ and $b$ must appear together as an adjacent pair in the array at least twice!
